---
import { MAVEN_SCHOOL_URL } from '../data/learning';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Jai Bhagat | The person building Dharmic Data</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Jai Bhagat won an NVIDIA hackathon with friends. Now he is building Dharmic Data, a school for paid learning and a shared AI future." />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Jai Bhagat | The person building Dharmic Data" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Years of teaching, a caring invention and a school imagined with others." />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://dharmicdata.org/dharmic-assets/jai-portrait-motion.jpg" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/school.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="site-header shell">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Dharmic Data home"><span aria-hidden="true" class="brand-mark">✳</span> Dharmic Data</a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="/#school">The school</a>
        <a href="/about" aria-current="page">Jai's story</a>
        <a href="https://literature.dharmicdata.org">The library <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href="/#learn">Learn with Jai <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="main" class="shell about-main">
      <section class="about-intro" aria-labelledby="about-title">
        <div class="about-opening">
          <p class="eyebrow">Jai Bhagat / The person making this bet</p>
          <h1 id="about-title">I won an NVIDIA hackathon <em>with friends.</em></h1>
          <p class="about-lead">Now I'm building a school where people get paid to learn and help shape their communities' AI future.</p>
          <p>Our idea was a supportive call from your future self. I teamed up with former Cityblock coworkers at the New York hackathon hosted by NVIDIA, MongoDB and Dell. We called our team American Exceptionalism.</p>
          <p>The Dell Pro Max with GB10 we won expanded what I could build with my MacBooks. Care and teaching were already part of my life. The prize gave me more means to continue.</p>
          <div class="about-actions">
            <a class="button" href={MAVEN_SCHOOL_URL}>Learn with me on Maven <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a class="text-link" href="/#school">Explore the school we're building <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="about-portrait">
          <img src="/dharmic-assets/jai-portrait-motion.jpg" alt="Jai Bhagat during his Dogged Pursuits conversation" width="2025" height="3600" />
          <figcaption>I like being at the whiteboard, imagining with someone.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </section>

      <section class="about-chapter" aria-labelledby="teaching-title">
        <h2 id="teaching-title">Teaching is the work<br />I return to.</h2>
        <div class="about-prose">
          <p>In 2022, I started my business with a virtual conference and mentoring. I went on to give lectures and lead community workshops. In 2025, trying to build an AI business exposed gaps in my understanding of inference infrastructure.</p>
          <p>Coding agents helped me build again. I began teaching live workshops around what I was learning. I want to make room for that kind of development with people who can help you work through the difficult parts.</p>
          <p>I'm a first-generation American born in the Bronx, with Gujarati and Dharmic roots. My traditions and chosen teachers inform how I approach the work. You do not need to share my beliefs to belong here.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about-chapter" aria-labelledby="school-title">
        <h2 id="school-title">A school for<br />a future we share.</h2>
        <div class="about-prose">
          <p>Dharmic Data is the emerging school. Conscious Compute is its signature workshop series. My bet is to pay a generation to become builders, owners and stewards of the AI their communities depend on.</p>
          <p>The school needs protected learning time and human mentorship. We are developing funded paid-learner places alongside online and premium learning, where attendees pay separately.</p>
          <p>To me, American Exceptionalism means taking responsibility for improving our shared institutions through imagination and cooperation. I want excellent engineers, creatives and local learners to find work worth doing together.</p>
          <p>A good teacher can change the course of someone's life. A great teacher can change the course of an entire civilization. That is the belief I want to put into practice.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="https://literature.dharmicdata.org">Explore the stories in the Civilizational Shelf <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer shell">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span> Dharmic Data</a>
      <p>A school imagined with love.<br />Built through the work of learning.</p>
      <div><a href={MAVEN_SCHOOL_URL}>Learn with Jai on Maven <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="https://literature.dharmicdata.org">Civilizational Shelf <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="mailto:jai@aplusactive.com">Say hello</a></div>
      <span class="footer-note">Dharmic Data is an emerging school. Programs and funded places are being developed.</span>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .about-main { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem) 2rem; }
  .about-intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(0, .75fr); align-items: start; gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem); padding-bottom: 4.5rem; }
  .about-opening h1 { font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 5.6vw, 5.2rem); line-height: 1.08; }
  .about-opening h1 em { text-decoration: none; }
  .about-opening > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 40rem; }
  .about-opening .about-lead { margin-block: 1.6rem; font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .about-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .9rem 1.6rem; margin-top: 1.8rem; }
  .about-portrait { margin: .5rem 0 0; }
  .about-portrait img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 32rem; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 42%; border-radius: 4px; }
  .about-portrait figcaption { margin-top: .85rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .about-chapter { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .85fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem); padding-block: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .about-chapter h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); line-height: 1.1; }
  .about-prose { max-width: 43rem; }
  .about-prose p:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .about-prose p { margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  .about-prose .text-link { margin-top: .4rem; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about-intro, .about-chapter { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.7rem; }
    .about-intro { padding-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .about-opening h1 { max-width: 42rem; }
    .about-portrait { max-width: 25rem; }
    .about-portrait img { height: 25rem; }
    .about-chapter { padding-block: 2.5rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 440px) {
    .about-opening h1 { font-size: 3rem; }
    .about-opening .about-lead { font-size: 1.15rem; }
    .about-actions { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
